                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is decent for early alpha, but I have a few things I'd like to see fixed.\n\n* There are random crashes, I've noticed most of them occur when I'm brousing the waivers and trying to claim players.\n* My bottom pairing D and 4th line forwards get very minimal icetime, when in reality these players would play maybe 7-12 minutes, in this game I've seen the numbers hover around 2-4. \n* Saving doesn't work, and I am unable to load 'saves' after exiting, or crashing, from them. \n\nThese are just my early observations.\n\nI look forward to playing the game and I believe in its potential. I trust the developers will continue to work on and improve the game, and it will be a great game in the future.",
